.git
.claude
.gitignore

# The workspace file points outside the build context; leaving it in would
# make the image build fail confusingly rather than resolve the module.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Local dev-only artifacts. The bot's data directory holds its private keys,
# so copying one into an image layer would bake an identity into a published
# image -- state is always a mounted volume, never part of the image.
/data
*.exe
.env
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

/bin
/dist

README.md
docs
